1
00:00:00,213 --> 00:00:05,053
(Wil Wheaton:)-I think he's got me.
-The year was 1995.

2
00:00:06,511 --> 00:00:09,011
(Sheldon:)The place, Jackson, Mississippi.

3
00:00:09,389 --> 00:00:11,679
Having spent 10 hours on a bus...

4
00:00:11,850 --> 00:00:14,810
(Sheldon:)...during which I had
to twice violate my personal rule...

5
00:00:15,020 --> 00:00:18,360
(Sheldon:)...against relieving myself
onboard a moving vehicle...

6
00:00:19,816 --> 00:00:23,236
(Sheldon:)...I finally arrived at the
Fourth Annual Dixie Trek Convention...

7
00:00:23,403 --> 00:00:27,113
(Sheldon:)...only to find that my idol,
Wil Wheaton...

8
00:00:27,282 --> 00:00:31,702
(Sheldon:)...decided he had better things to do
than show up and sign my action figure.

9
00:00:35,582 --> 00:00:37,042
(Leonard:)What?

10
00:00:38,877 --> 00:00:40,837
(Sheldon:)You betrayed me, Wil Wheaton.

11
00:00:41,046 --> 00:00:45,426
(Sheldon:)Now I have my revenge.

12
00:00:47,427 --> 00:00:50,267
You went to the '95 Dixie Trek?

13
00:00:51,640 --> 00:01:00,020
(Wil Wheaton:)Oh, dude, my grandmother had just died,
and I had to go to her funeral.

